{# twig template — /fencing landing page + 4 variant sub-pages.

   Thin page shell. All structural markup lives in
   templates/layouts/service-landing.html.twig. The controller
   (DefaultController::getFencing) supplies all content variables
   (hero_image, hero_headline, hero_subheading, services, services_*,
   closing_prompt, trust_items, fencing_landing_type, landing_type,
   etc.) that the layout consumes.

   On the default page (`fencing_landing_type` null) the shared
   services loop renders each service card as a full-card `<a>` to
   its matching variant URL (controller supplies `item.href`). On
   variant sub-pages the services loop renders decorative cards
   (no href). #}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block page_title %}Fencing Contractor in Middle Georgia — KasKo Construction{% endblock %}
{% block page_meta_description %}Professional fence installation and repair throughout Middle Georgia. Privacy, wood, chain link, and fence repair from a local contractor.{% endblock %}

{% block page_content %}
    {% include 'layouts/service-landing.html.twig' %}
{% endblock %}
